  </div>

  <div class="sec-label" id="monograph">The monograph</div>
  <a class="feature" href="/pdf">
    <div class="t">hyperactivity</div>
    <div class="s">One 0-postulate cubical type theory + confluent degree-2 interaction nets compiling proofs straight to native C11, Metal/CUDA GPU kernels, 7nm Calma GDSII lithography masks, 48 kHz WebAssembly DSP, and clockless PoUW coordination.</div>
  </a>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="act primary" href="/pdf">Read Monograph (PDF)</a>
    <a class="act" href="/paper.pdf" download="hyperactivity.pdf">Download PDF</a>
    <a class="act" href="/learn">First Principles</a>
    <a class="act" href="/ide">IDE</a>
    <a class="act" href="/kg">Knowledge Graph</a>
    <a class="act" href="/daw">DAW</a>
    <button type="button" class="act" onclick="window.hxKG && window.hxKG.openOracle()">Talk to THIS ✦</button>
  </div>

  <div class="sec-label" id="chip-wasm">Live In-Browser Symbolic Chip Design (real /cubical.wasm · lib/hx-synth.hypercubical)</div>
  <div class="chip-lab" id="hx-chip-lab">
    <div class="chip-lab-head">
      <span class="chip-lab-title">Exact Optimal NAND2 Gate Superoptimizer + 7nm FinFET Mask Projector</span>
      <span class="chip-lab-sub">hs-verify &amp; hs-id running live in /cubical.wasm</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-presets">
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn on" data-tt="102" data-maxd="4" data-name="XOR2 (a ⊕ b)">XOR2 (102 · 4 NAND2)</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn" data-tt="15" data-maxd="1" data-name="NOT (¬a)">NOT (15 · 1 NAND2)</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn" data-tt="192" data-maxd="2" data-name="AND2 (a ∧ b)">AND2 (192 · 2 NAND2)</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn" data-tt="252" data-maxd="3" data-name="OR2 (a ∨ b)">OR2 (252 · 3 NAND2)</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn" data-tt="202" data-maxd="4" data-name="MUX2 (c ? b : a)">MUX2 (202 · 4 NAND2)</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn" data-tt="232" data-maxd="6" data-name="MAJ3_CARRY">MAJ3_CARRY (232 · 6 NAND2)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <span>truth table (0–255):</span>
      <input type="number" id="chip-tt" min="0" max="255" value="102">
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn primary" id="chip-run">Synthesize &amp; Prove in /cubical.wasm ▸</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip-btn danger" id="chip-tamper">Flip 1 Gate Bit (Break Proof)</button>
