    <div class="chip-log" id="chip-log">Select any Boolean specification and run exact symbolic NAND2 synthesis + proof verification directly inside /cubical.wasm (zero heuristics, zero LLM).</div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec-label" id="hypergraph">The hypergraph</div>
