    Everything in this system is derived in dependency order from one self-hosted cubical checker (<code>lib/check.hypercubical</code>) and one confluent interaction-net machine (<code>lib/kernel.hypercubical</code>). Click any node to trace its upstream dependencies and open its ground-up exposition.
  </p>

  <div class="hg-diagram">
    <div class="hg-svg-wrap">
