      </div>
      <p class="hg-ins-desc" id="hgDesc">One 0-postulate cubical checker (Brunerie = -2) + confluent degree-2 interaction-net machine (vxchg, 0 GC, 0 MESI) compiling directly to 575 KB /cubical.wasm, native ARM64 C11 (0 UB), Metal/CUDA shaders, and 7nm GDSII lithography.</p>
