        <span class="hg-ins-deps" id="hgDeps">derives → /learn · /hyperfactor · /decentralized · /silicon · /ai · /physics · /neuro · /daw</span>
        <a class="hg-ins-go" id="hgLink" href="/learn">Open First Principles →</a>
      </div>
