  </div>

  <ul class="list">
    <li>
      <a href="/learn">
        <span class="l-idx">01</span>
        <span class="l-body">
          <span class="l-title">Hyperactivity from First Principles</span>
          <span class="l-desc">0-postulate cubical type theory, degree-2 active pairs (●═●), lock-free vxchg, §4.5 pruning &amp; the content-addressed Merkle store (5.15× warm checks).</span>
        </span>
        <span class="l-path">/learn</span>
      </a>
